{"id":"property-value-50m-100m-plus","version":2,"category":"property-value","when":"US$50,000,000–100,000,000+ estimated property-value label, used only as a subjective design-ambition reference. Property value is not a construction budget. Location, land value, market conditions, condition and other factors affect prices; this band establishes no market-price or cost claim.","title":"Design-ambition reference: Exceptional estate: personalized ambition","combinations":"Terra may combine, reinterpret or omit these subjective ideas with relevant regional, style, climate, entrance, roof, facade, material and room-planning knowledge. Amenities are optional inspirations, never mandatory. Do not constrain creative freedom through a fixed template, geometry, area, storey, room or amenity count.","placement":"Let the household brief, site, climate, privacy and architectural concept determine spatial relationships. Connect arrival, shared living and sheltered outdoor space where appropriate; separate guest, private and service movement when useful. No fixed floor areas, storey counts or room counts follow from the value label.","principles":"Explore differentiated residential volumes connected by intentional arrival, gardens and sheltered circulation, with estate-wide privacy and discreet guest and service relationships. Consider exceptional craftsmanship, demanding but coherent architectural sections and deeply personalized spaces. A guest house, cultural room, recreation or wellness building may be justified by actual use; complexity and amenities need not grow with price. These are flexible inspirations, not requirements or price-derived promises.","capabilities":"Translate selected ideas into actual supported scene operations, with coordinated floors, enclosures, openings, entrances, roofs and terraces. Craftsmanship and spatial quality remain design intentions until supported by geometry and review. Disclose missing access, interiors and other unsupported capabilities;