{"id":"legacy-recipe-5ef674af-406c-465c-8608-4f8cbe8e46fc","version":1,"category":"climate-site","when":"Existing planting recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Garden Screen 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"frame edges without blocking primary garden outlook\",\"target\":\"terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"set back at least 1.5 m from coping\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"provide concealed drip zones for layered planting\",\"target\":\"irrigation\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"maintain a 1.2 m clear maintenance route\",\"target\":\"path\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid placement within vehicle sight triangles\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Layer tall palms and small-canopy trees behind dense broad-leaf understory. Create alternating planted masses and view gaps rather than a continuous hedge. Use salt-tolerant species on beach sites and windward exposures. Step planting with contours on hillside sites; do not create level soil banks. Place sculptural rock accents only at bed turns and focal view gaps. Conceal lighting within foliage and aim upward away from interior glazing. Keep planting clear of drainage lines, pool equipment, and emergency access.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"plantingBedDepth\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"screenLength\",\"max\":30,\"min\":4,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"canopyPlantSpacing\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.8,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":3},{\"key\":\"understoryPlantSpacing\",\"max\":1.5,\"min\":0.4,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.8},{\"key\":\"screenHeight\",\"max\":8,\"min\":2.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":4.5},{\"key\":\"openViewPercentage\",\"max\":60,\"min\":15,\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":35},{\"key\":\"accentBoulderCount\",\"max\":10,\"min\":0,\"unit\":\"count\",\"value\":3},{\"key\":\"nightLighting\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":